OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FHeavy and thundery showers will
OL,6,Fsoon clear eastwards. The rest of the
OL,7,Fday will be mainly dry and bright with
OL,8,Fscattered showers in the west. Best of
OL,9,Fthe warm sunshine across the Lothians
OL,10,Fand Borders.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FBright spells and scattered
OL,13,Fshowers in the evening. Mostly dry
OL,14,Fovernight with clear spells but the
OL,15,Fodd shower will affect the west.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FA lot of dry and bright
OL,18,Fweather. A few scattered showers in
OL,19,Fthe west at first, these spreading
OL,20,Feast in the afternoon. Feeling cooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
